{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "Ridgeline Player Limits API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Responsible-gaming eligibility: self-exclusion, cool-off and daily wager limits. **The single source of truth for player protection. Never reimplement this logic in a caller.** Self-excluded and cool-off players must not receive promotional offers (`may_receive_promotions: false`).\n\n**Responsible-gaming eligibility**: self-exclusion, cool-off and daily wager limits. This is the **single source of truth for player protection**. Never reimplement these rules in a caller.\n\n**Owner:** Team Responsible Gaming · **Consumers:** bets (safety net), bet-slip, promotions tooling, boost-ops agent\n\nTwo different questions, one call:\n- **May they wager this amount now?** → `eligible` (considers `amount_minor` against the daily limit).\n- **May they receive any promotion?** → `may_receive_promotions`. This is `false` for self-excluded and cool-off players **regardless of amount**.\n\n\n| Player | State | Status | Use it to test |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `P-1001` | NJ | active | the happy path |\n| `P-1002` | PA | active, $20.00 left of a $50.00 daily limit | `DAILY_WAGER_LIMIT` |\n| `P-1003` | MI | **self-excluded** until 2027-06-30 | blocked wagers, **no promotions** |\n| `P-1004` | NY | active | casino not available in state |\n| `P-1005` | NJ | **cool-off** | blocked wagers, **no promotions** |\n\n\n## Authentication\n\nSend `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. **Each API has its own key**, and a key for one API is rejected by the others.\n\nKeys are never handed out directly. Request access and you receive a **credential reference** such as `{{vault:RIDGELINE_BETS_KEY}}`. A secure access proxy (Postman Passport) swaps the reference for the real key at call time, so neither your code, your agent nor its logs ever hold the secret.\n\n| Response | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `401 unauthorized` | Missing key, or a key for a different API |\n| `401 unresolved_reference` | A `{{vault:...}}` reference reached the API unresolved: the call skipped the proxy |\n\n\n## Conventions\n\n- **Base URL:** `https://<host>/<api>`, e.g. `https://<host>/bets/v1/bets`. Paths are exact (no path parameters), so access grants can match method + host + path.\n- **Money:** every amount is an **integer in minor units (cents)**. `1000` = $10.00. Decimals are rejected.\n- **Products:** `sportsbook` or `casino`.\n- **Players:** sandbox players `P-1001` to `P-1005` (see each API's notes).\n- **Errors:** JSON `{ \"error\": \"<code>\", \"message\": \"<human readable>\" }`, plus extra fields where noted.\n- **Idempotency:** write endpoints that move value take an `idempotency_key` or are naturally idempotent (claims).\n\n*Ridgeline is a fictional company; all data is sandbox data.*",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Team Responsible Gaming"
    },
    "x-owner": "Team Responsible Gaming"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://{host}/player-limits",
      "description": "Hosted sandbox (route through Passport)",
      "variables": {
        "host": {
          "default": "your-project.vercel.app"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:4100/player-limits",
      "description": "Local (next dev)"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "player-limits",
      "description": "Responsible-gaming eligibility: self-exclusion, cool-off and daily wager limits. **The single source of truth for player protection. Never reimplement this logic in a caller.** Self-excluded and cool-off players must not receive promotional offers (`may_receive_promotions: false`). Owner: Team Responsible Gaming."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/eligibility/check": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "player-limits"
        ],
        "operationId": "player_limits_post_eligibility_check",
        "summary": "Check whether a player may wager / receive promotions",
        "description": "Check a player before any wager, offer, boost or claim. Pass `amount_minor` to include the daily-limit check. A player can be ineligible for a wager (`DAILY_WAGER_LIMIT`) yet still allowed promotions.\n\n**Errors**\n\n| Status | `error` | When |\n|---|---|---|\n| 400 | `invalid_product` | `product` is not `sportsbook` or `casino`. |\n| 404 | `player_not_found` | Unknown `player_id`. |\n| 401 | `unauthorized` / `unresolved_reference` | Missing or wrong key, or an unresolved Passport reference |",
        "parameters": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Success",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "player_id",
                    "eligible",
                    "reasons",
                    "may_receive_promotions"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "player_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Sandbox player ID, `P-1001` to `P-1005`."
                    },
                    "product": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "sportsbook",
                        "casino"
                      ],
                      "description": "`sportsbook` or `casino`."
                    },
                    "eligible": {
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "description": "`true` if the player may place this wager now."
                    },
                    "reasons": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                          "SELF_EXCLUDED",
                          "COOL_OFF",
                          "DAILY_WAGER_LIMIT"
                        ]
                      },
                      "description": "Why the player is blocked: `SELF_EXCLUDED`, `COOL_OFF`, `DAILY_WAGER_LIMIT`. Empty when eligible."
                    },
                    "may_receive_promotions": {
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "description": "`false` for self-excluded and cool-off players. Callers must not show, offer or claim any promotion when this is `false`."
                    },
                    "remaining_daily_wager_minor": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "description": "How much more the player may wager today, in cents."
                    },
                    "checked_at": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "date-time",
                      "description": "When the check ran (ISO 8601)."
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "player_id": "P-1003",
                  "product": "sportsbook",
                  "eligible": false,
                  "reasons": [
                    "SELF_EXCLUDED"
                  ],
                  "may_receive_promotions": false,
                  "remaining_daily_wager_minor": 50000,
                  "checked_at": "2026-10-07T18:57:35.931Z"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "`invalid_product`: `product` is not `sportsbook` or `casino`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "invalid_product": {
                    "summary": "product is not sportsbook or casino.",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "invalid_product",
                      "message": "product is not sportsbook or casino."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid bearer key, or an unresolved Passport reference.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "unauthorized": {
                    "summary": "Missing key or another API's key",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unauthorized",
                      "message": "Missing or invalid bearer key for this API."
                    }
                  },
                  "unresolved_reference": {
                    "summary": "A {{vault:...}} reference skipped the proxy",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unresolved_reference",
                      "message": "Received an unresolved Passport reference. Route this call through the Passport Secure Access Proxy."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "`player_not_found`: Unknown `player_id`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "player_not_found": {
                    "summary": "Unknown player_id.",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "player_not_found",
                      "message": "Unknown player_id."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Unexpected server error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "internal",
                  "message": "Unexpected error."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "player_id",
                  "product"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "player_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Sandbox player ID, `P-1001` to `P-1005`."
                  },
                  "product": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "sportsbook",
                      "casino"
                    ],
                    "description": "`sportsbook` or `casino`."
                  },
                  "amount_minor": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "minimum": 1,
                    "description": "Amount in minor units (cents). Integer, at least 1."
                  }
                }
              },
              "example": {
                "player_id": "P-1003",
                "product": "sportsbook",
                "amount_minor": 1000
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/limits": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "player-limits"
        ],
        "operationId": "player_limits_post_limits",
        "summary": "Get a player's limits and status",
        "description": "Get a player's protection status and daily limit usage.\n\n**Errors**\n\n| Status | `error` | When |\n|---|---|---|\n| 404 | `player_not_found` | Unknown `player_id`. |\n| 401 | `unauthorized` / `unresolved_reference` | Missing or wrong key, or an unresolved Passport reference |",
        "parameters": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Success",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object"
                },
                "example": {
                  "player_id": "P-1002",
                  "status": "active",
                  "daily_wager_limit_minor": 5000,
                  "wagered_today_minor": 3000
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid request: missing fields, invalid JSON or invalid values.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "missing_fields",
                  "message": "Missing required field(s): player_id.",
                  "fields": [
                    "player_id"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid bearer key, or an unresolved Passport reference.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "unauthorized": {
                    "summary": "Missing key or another API's key",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unauthorized",
                      "message": "Missing or invalid bearer key for this API."
                    }
                  },
                  "unresolved_reference": {
                    "summary": "A {{vault:...}} reference skipped the proxy",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "unresolved_reference",
                      "message": "Received an unresolved Passport reference. Route this call through the Passport Secure Access Proxy."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "`player_not_found`: Unknown `player_id`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "player_not_found": {
                    "summary": "Unknown player_id.",
                    "value": {
                      "error": "player_not_found",
                      "message": "Unknown player_id."
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Unexpected server error.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "error",
                    "message"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "internal",
                  "message": "Unexpected error."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "player_id"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "player_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Sandbox player ID, `P-1001` to `P-1005`."
                  }
                }
              },
              "example": {
                "player_id": "P-1002"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "Use the Passport reference {{vault:RIDGELINE_PLAYER_LIMITS_KEY}}. Never a raw key."
      }
    }
  }
}
